WEBVTT

00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,290
Hi everyone, my name is Marco Muthi and I am a

00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:04,580
football performance coach. I have been a coach

00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:07,410
for the last 10 years of my life and probably

00:00:07,410 --> 00:00:10,240
across this time, across schools, crossfit clubs,

00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:12,900
one-to-one bases, I probably coached about 500

00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,260
players in my lifetime. On a one-to-one basis,

00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:16,713
ever since I launched my business about two and

00:00:16,713 --> 00:00:17,827
a half years ago, I've probably coached about

00:00:17,827 --> 00:00:18,940
50

00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:21,620
players individually. I've noticed that nearly

00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:24,260
the majority of them all have the exact same

00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:25,990
problem when it comes to training, which is they

00:00:25,990 --> 00:00:27,720
don't know whether they are actually improving.

00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,820
If you were to ask a player right now if you have

00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:31,920
gotten quicker this year, you will probably

00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:33,990
just guess. You'll feel quicker, you'll probably

00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:35,940
feel stronger, a bit more agile,

00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:38,150
but unfortunately feeling is not the same as actually

00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:40,260
knowing and being objective with it.

00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:42,580
So this is where I come in and I do the actual

00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:44,900
physical performance testing side of it and I

00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:47,690
focus on four components. Agility side, your sprint

00:00:47,690 --> 00:00:50,480
abilities, your engine, so how conditioned

00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:53,130
you are and are you able to perform in the 88th

00:00:53,130 --> 00:00:55,780
minute the exact same way as the first minute,

00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:58,070
also your power ability. You get one session tested

00:00:58,070 --> 00:01:00,360
on the day within 60 to 90 minutes

00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:02,590
and then from there you get a full detailed analysis

00:01:02,590 --> 00:01:04,820
and report within two to three days.

00:01:05,260 --> 00:01:07,600
Every number benchmarked against your position

00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,940
and age group where you are strong and then the

00:01:09,940 --> 00:01:11,720
main one for me is where you are losing that time.

00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:13,500
For those that wish to continue working with me,

00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:15,810
I will be providing you with a six-week personalized

00:01:15,810 --> 00:01:17,740
performance plan that will be

00:01:18,020 --> 00:01:20,730
targeting your strengths, your weaknesses, and

00:01:20,730 --> 00:01:23,440
then this will be accessed via my M2 platform

00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:24,960
that I have created and your training sessions

00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:26,480
will likely last only between 15 to 30 minutes

00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:28,000
a

00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,550
day. That is really all you need to focus on one

00:01:30,550 --> 00:01:33,100
certain component. After six weeks we will then

00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:35,750
retest. So the same session, same markers, same

00:01:35,750 --> 00:01:38,400
timing and from there you will see a difference

00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:40,610
in your numbers. I firmly believe that if you

00:01:40,610 --> 00:01:42,820
train the right thing your numbers will increase,

00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:45,690
you will see improvement on the pitch. You will

00:01:45,690 --> 00:01:48,080
slowly become an athlete at the same time as

00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:50,000
becoming a footballer. If you wish to work with

00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,920
me, drop me a whatsapp or send me an email.

00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:53,320
I'm looking forward to getting in contact with

00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:54,720
you and to work together.
